      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Epidemiology of bronchial asthma is analyzed in many trials over the world. The prevalence of disease is dependent to genetic and environmental factors. Some connections have been shown in the paper. The data from international programs focused on allergic diseases have been presented in relation to our observations."},
